    "reason": "[ev-437e36865221] says only that `Telemetry` customization is now supported in the waypoint proxy. So the exposed environments are those that use Telemetry resources together with waypoint proxies. The proposed condition, gvk-in-use Telemetry on its own, is broader than that: it also flags sidecar-only environments with no waypoints. The evidence and section context ([ev-a3db376e8800] covers CEL attributes, not waypoints) do not say how a waypoint shows up in configuration, or whether existing Telemetry resources now apply to waypoints, so I cannot write the narrower condition from evidence alone.",
